{"parentUuid":"9bce2a7f-ce78-440b-8214-0133ffad3bf7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"29151c9b-83a8-49a2-816c-83765b5a32a1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"我有两台电脑，一台mac居家使用，一台windows上班使用。两台电脑上都安装了claudecode，在实际使用时windows上用claudecode写了自定义的skill，但是到了家，mac上确没有，很不方便，有什么方式可以同步或者更好的使用吗"},"uuid":"b802f6c9-530d-4c9e-ba28-644e2e92afff","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:01:33.521Z","permissionMode":"default","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"b802f6c9-530d-4c9e-ba28-644e2e92afff","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"0648746d90ef4bd2f6504a9f8a3b662d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户在问如何同步 Claude Code 的自定义 skills between Windows (work) and Mac (home). 这是一个很实际的问题。\n\n让我想想 Claude Code 的 skills 是如何存储的，以及如何同步：\n\n1. Skills 通常存储在配置目录中\n2. 在 Windows 上通常在 `%APPDATA%\\Claude\\ClaudeCode\\...`\n3. 在 Mac 上通常在 `~/.claude/...`\n\n我需要了解具体的存储路径和同步方式。让我用 Agent 工具来研究一下这个问题，或者直接搜索相关信息。\n\n实际上，用户想要的是跨设备同步 custom skills 的解决方案。我应该给出几个可行的方案：\n\n1. 使用云同步服务（iCloud, Dropbox, Google Drive 等）\n2. 使用 Git 同步 dotfiles\n3. 使用 dotfiles 管理器（chezmoi, yadm 等）\n\n让我给用户一些实用的建议。\n","signature":"63a3eddb347e037b8675d93f96ac1ced29c9dba38710c1e3dcefc9db4a1894d9"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":115,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":22400,"output_tokens":422,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"126ac05c-ad24-47de-adf0-e31e44121e65","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:01:54.321Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"126ac05c-ad24-47de-adf0-e31e44121e65","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"0648746d90ef4bd2f6504a9f8a3b662d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n这是个常见问题。自定义 skills 存储在本地配置目录，跨设备同步有几种方式：\n\n## 同步方案\n\n**1. 云盘同步（最简单）**\n把你的 Claude Code 配置目录指向云盘（如 iCloud、Dropbox、OneDrive）：\n\n- **Mac**: `~/.claude/`\n- **Windows**: `%USERPROFILE%\\.claude\\`\n\n在两台电脑上登录同一个云盘服务，把配置目录软链接或直接放在云盘目录内。\n\n**2. Git dotfiles 管理（推荐，版本控制）**\n```bash\n# 把配置目录做成 git repo\ncd ~/.claude\ngit init\n# 添加 remote，push 到 GitHub/GitLab\ngit remote add origin git@github.com:you/dotfiles.git\n```\n\n**3. 符号链接方案**\n在云盘里放一份统一的 skills，在各设备上创建符号链接指向它。\n\n## 快速操作建议\n\n你可以在 Mac 上先看看你的 skills 目录在哪里：\n```bash\nls -la ~/.claude/settings.json 2>/dev/null || ls -la ~/Library/Application\\ Support/Claude/\n```\n\n告诉我你的 skills 文件路径，我可以帮你设计具体的同步方案。"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":115,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":22400,"output_tokens":422,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"1159fdc1-4fa5-434d-8eff-52dd6fb235ce","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:01:57.446Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
