{"parentUuid":"9c9deebd-e635-4b9a-9c77-b87d621c1621","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"0648760d55eda7e7e2783b14ac2a5ba3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n搜索失败了，但这些是圈内比较有名的 dotfiles repo：\n\n**1. [thoughtbot/dotfiles](https://github.com/thoughtbot/dotfiles)**\n- 最早最经典，Ruby/ Rails 开发者圈子用得多\n- 用 `rcm` 工具管理符号链接\n- 包含 vim、git、tmux 等配置\n\n**2. [mathiasbynens/dotfiles](https://github.com/mathiasbynens/dotfiles)**\n- Mozilla 前端工程师维护\n- macOS 默认值设置很全面（鼠标速度、spotlight 快捷键等）\n- 脚本写得很干净，注释详细，适合学习\n\n**3. [Nick LaRosa - nicksp/dotfiles](https://github.com/nicksp/dotfiles)**\n- 结构清晰，skill 类的任务按功能分区\n- 包含 brew、node、python 开发环境配置\n\n---\n\n**核心思路都差不多：**\n```\ndotfiles/\n├── .gitconfig\n├── .zshrc\n├── skills/          ← 自定义 skills\n│   └── my-skill/\n│       └── skill.ts\n└── install.sh       ← 一键符号链接到 ~\n```\n\n你自己挑一个进去看看目录结构，会发现都是几百行的 shell 脚本 + 配置文件。"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":22848,"output_tokens":283,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"27b43f1f-16b1-4a57-a3d8-f92fd3ca26c1","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:08:44.724Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
