{"parentUuid":"ef010a3b-9670-45c0-93ca-1d1f76aa0118","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4cb3c1ba-6a94-4234-a7e8-b10a3da48ae2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"dotfiles是什么，是什么约定俗成的说法吗，只使用skill的同步还是所有配置的同步"},"uuid":"94cb3154-50b7-4ed3-ada0-2245ad76ee5c","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:10:12.879Z","permissionMode":"default","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"94cb3154-50b7-4ed3-ada0-2245ad76ee5c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"064876751dce6ebb6af9f1874477d420","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户问的是 dotfiles 的定义和范围问题。\n\ndotfiles 是 Unix/Linux 系统的传统说法。在 Unix 系统里，以 `.` 开头的文件/目录在 ls 里默认不显示（隐藏文件），这些被称为 dotfiles。传统上包括 shell 配置（.bashrc, .zshrc）、编辑器配置（.vimrc）等用户个人配置文件。\n\n在现代开发语境下，dotfiles 泛指用户在 home 目录下那些以点开头的个性化配置文件。\n\n关于同步范围：理论上可以同步所有 dotfiles（shell配置、编辑器配置、git配置等），不仅仅是 Claude Code 的 skills。用户问的是只同步 skills 还是所有配置。\n\n我应该解释清楚这个概念，然后给出建议。\n","signature":"f7a2dc65fa0322d620896f4fe77d385184e90b5ef0e7567be3b43f7d60d6d0ef"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":341,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":22976,"output_tokens":319,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"7809d920-9b47-4be5-a3ec-dcb8d97d22ff","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:10:25.402Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"7809d920-9b47-4be5-a3ec-dcb8d97d22ff","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"064876751dce6ebb6af9f1874477d420","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**dotfiles** 是 Unix 的传统叫法。home 目录下以 `.` 开头的隐藏文件（目录），比如 `.bashrc`、`.gitconfig`、`.vimrc` 等，Unix 里习惯叫 dotfiles。这个名字沿用至今。\n\n---\n\n**同步范围看你自己：**\n\n- **只同步 skills** — 最简单，文件少，冲突概率低\n- **同步所有配置** — shell、git、编辑器、终端等全部纳入版本控制\n\n大多数人的 dotfiles repo 会包含：\n```\n~/.gitconfig      # git 别名、用户名\n~/.zshrc          # shell 环境\n~/.vimrc          # vim 配置\n~/.claude/skills/ # Claude Code skills ← 你关心的\n```\n\n**建议从 skills 开始**，简单干净，等熟悉了再逐步扩展。\n\n你现在 Windows 上的 skills 目录结构是什么样的？"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":341,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":22976,"output_tokens":319,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"727cc311-2cb9-4cff-a2e7-a8fe003015d9","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:10:33.436Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
