{"parentUuid":"ca20a8e3-5de7-4010-8d53-02a0fba4e8b3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8ae8dedc-ac9e-4f53-b949-d53c7767ebd5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"后续是不是可以用git remote add origin git@github.com:you/dotfiles/xx.git 来控制具体的某个默认配置"},"uuid":"a954e59d-935e-488c-9fc9-7386c2132e1c","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:12:18.201Z","permissionMode":"default","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"a954e59d-935e-488c-9fc9-7386c2132e1c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"064876f212870f4d43d9e419950764df","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户在问关于 git remote add origin 来控制具体的某个默认配置。这个问题有点模糊，我觉得他想问的是：\n\n1. 是不是可以用不同的 git remote 来分别管理不同的配置（比如 Claude skills vs shell 配置）？\n2. 或者他可能误解了 git remote 的作用？\n\n实际上：\n- 每个 git repo 只能有一个 remote（但可以有多个 remote url 作为 backup）\n- 如果你想分开管理不同的配置（比如 Claude skills 是一个 repo，shell 配置是另一个 repo），你需要创建两个独立的 git repo\n\n让我解释清楚这个概念。\n","signature":"57e669ab8aebf222ca2a6081b386b024a567cdf5a8be2dd1f0ef42dd8e05458f"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":230,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":23296,"output_tokens":288,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"262a2b2e-abbc-43ce-9b5a-fe921cf9da23","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:12:29.918Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"262a2b2e-abbc-43ce-9b5a-fe921cf9da23","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"064876f212870f4d43d9e419950764df","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n这里有个小误解：\n\n**一个 git repo 只能绑定一个 remote**，不能按文件切分。\n\n但你可以这样规划：\n\n```\n~/dotfiles/\n├── .git/              ← 只有一个 git repo\n├── skills/            ← Claude skills ← 这个受 git 管理\n├── .gitconfig\n└── .zshrc\n```\n\n所有东西都在一个 repo 里，通过**目录结构**分开管理，而不是多个 remote。\n\n---\n\n**如果你想分开管理**（比如 Claude skills 是私密的不想公开，shell 配置想公开），那需要两个独立的 repo：\n\n```bash\n# 两个独立的 git repo\n~/dotfiles-skills/.git/    ← Claude skills 私有\n~/dotfiles-public/.git/    ← shell 配置 公开\n```\n\n---\n\n**对新手而言，建议先用一个 repo 把所有配置放进去**，简单好管。等有需要再拆成多个 repo。"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":230,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":23296,"output_tokens":288,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"bfd19a1f-12fb-4710-a06f-9bfb42f16cf7","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:12:34.359Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
