{"parentUuid":"d63bb306-e936-4896-95a9-67733e74bcf1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"461e8fd8-f1cb-4ea5-89b0-5311295fb2ed","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"所以你的意思是我每次同步都会把所有设置都同步到我的电脑上？"},"uuid":"dfef8b49-d505-4727-9353-8bae5fd08e3e","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:13:40.083Z","permissionMode":"default","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"dfef8b49-d505-4727-9353-8bae5fd08e3e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"064877443d689afed623d3ea7673cc38","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户担心同步会把所有配置都同步到电脑上。\n\n是的，git 是按 repo 整体操作的，不是按单个文件。当你 `git pull` 或 `git clone` 时，会把整个 repo 的内容拉下来。\n\n但这不一定是坏事，因为 dotfiles 里所有文件都是他自己想要的，pull 下来正好就是完整的开发环境。\n\n如果他只想同步 skills，那他的 repo 里就只放 skills 相关的文件就好了，其他 `.gitconfig`、`.zshrc` 放进去或不放都行。\n\n或者他可以用 `.gitignore` 来排除某些文件。\n\n但核心问题是：git 操作的是整个 repo，不是单个文件或子目录。\n","signature":"6068675bee39e1627c5792dc50c263cf909f08b6faa1e3a3ea6edc213c06f6bc"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":242,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":23488,"output_tokens":290,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"d1ab7e77-04b2-482f-a6ed-edf7a7afc589","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:13:49.996Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"d1ab7e77-04b2-482f-a6ed-edf7a7afc589","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"064877443d689afed623d3ea7673cc38","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n对，git 按 **repo 整体**操作，不是按单个文件。\n\n但这没问题：\n\n```\n你的 dotfiles repo 结构：\n\ndotfiles/\n├── skills/          ← Claude skills（这个会同步到 Mac）\n├── .gitconfig       ← 你也可以放这个\n└── .zshrc           ← 也可以放这个\n```\n\n你往 repo 里放什么，`git pull` 就拉什么。\n\n- **不放 `.gitconfig`** → Mac 上就没有这个文件（也不会覆盖）\n- **只放 `skills/`** → Mac 上只会多出 skills 目录\n\n**简单说：放什么同步什么，不放的不动。**\n\n所以你完全可以只把 `skills/` 目录丢进 git repo，其他的留着不管。Mac 拉下来就只有 skills。"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":242,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":23488,"output_tokens":290,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"324fa6d2-3e0b-4c56-ac96-aed353a66661","timestamp":"2026-05-05T01:13:53.334Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"eff631cc-31aa-42d3-a279-0665c0e2e538","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
